@host = http://localhost:5050

### Token
# AiSearch.Api only validates RS256 signatures issued by Spot.Auth.Api.
# The DevController was removed: get a real JWT from the Spot.Auth.Api login
# endpoint and paste it below.
@token = REPLACE_WITH_RS256_SUPERADMIN_JWT

### 1. Audit list - no filters
GET {{host}}/ai-search/requests
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2. Audit list - filter by status and type
GET {{host}}/ai-search/requests?page=1&pageSize=10&status=SUCCESS&requestType=BUSINESS_SEARCH
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 3. Audit list - filter by user and date range
GET {{host}}/ai-search/requests?userId=3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6&from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-31T23:59:59Z
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 4. No token - must return 401 (body: { code: "UNAUTHORIZED", ... })
GET {{host}}/ai-search/requests

###

### 5. Token with a role other than SUPERADMIN - must return 403
GET {{host}}/ai-search/requests
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_RS256_CLIENT_ROLE_JWT

###
